{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Family Ledger Shared》是一款本地優先的家庭共享帳本，適合與家人共同記錄日常收支、核對統計及匯入帳單的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-73.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>家庭共享帳本功能</h2>\n<p>帳本分開記錄支出、收入、轉帳與退款，金額以整數分儲存，統計不作四捨五入。家庭成員可共用同一帳本，各自記錄並即時同步，且只能修改自己的條目；統計可按日、月、類別及成員查看。另支援微信、支付寶與 CSV / XLSX 匯入，先預覽後確認，無法讀取的行會另列。資料預設留在 iPhone，開啟 iCloud 同步後只存於私人 iCloud，並可用 Face ID 鎖定。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-314-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-315-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-316-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-317-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-318-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-319-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Family Ledger Shared</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/family-ledger-shared/id6818387789?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:41:44.402207+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:37:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:21.490824+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:21.490824+00:00","content_hash":"aa637a5290574a2044e84803b434764425f63d767f4901c82706fef9ccc3986a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}